# Remove once Spring Boot's BOM reaches pgjdbc 42.7.12 or later.
# Not exploitable: we don't connect with channelBinding=require.
CVE-2026-54291

# Remove once Spring Boot's BOM reaches httpcore5 5.4.3 or later. Both entries
# below are the same 5.4.2 -> 5.4.3 bump, and both are remote-peer DoS bugs in
# code we only ever run as a client: httpcore5 and httpcore5-h2 reach us via
# spring-boot-starter-elasticsearch and only ever talk to our own cluster.
# Inbound HTTP, including HTTP/2, is handled by Tomcat.
CVE-2026-54399
CVE-2026-54428
